{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> is a short first-person investigative psychological horror game about a husband trying to uncover the truth behind his wife\u2019s disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2010s, a housewife known as <strong>\u201cDahlia\u201d</strong> was reported missing after running away from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her husband, <strong>Bowo</strong>, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.poster.avif?t=1764936266\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.webm?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.mp4?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> delivers an  investigative experience through its authentic setting, where players will explore a small house and its surrounding area located in a quiet, remote suburban neighborhood in Indonesia. With its <strong>old camcorder-style visuals</strong>, the game evokes a chilling atmosphere reminiscent of a documentary capturing real events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>investigative gameplay</strong>, players are encouraged to search every corner, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind Dahlia\u2019s disappearance while feeling the <strong>tense and oppressive silence</strong> that lingers within every step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision and interpretation of the evidence will lead to <strong>multiple possible endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Remains of Dahlia</i></strong><i> is a short game, designed to be completed roughly in under one hour.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Forgotten in the Quiet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/4f32d389679e0f337f567e99825e5c8a234da8aa.jpg"},{"name":"The Never Ending Case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/729bfc36485fe7b2ba5dc0694f3bf4561920353d.jpg"},{"name":"Justice in My Own Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/70f1840d3323da7f7261c54dff0e1390d620ce88.jpg"},{"name":"The End of Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/ca718cf6c6f58abe4810d35e02ae2819bb98d970.jpg"},{"name":"Vanished Without a Trace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/f23d4875173c73575c4c414a630f773a06b2688f.jpg"},{"name":"Unmasking the Culprit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/c7538edb24eefa6dac7bad29b8c78282a2459169.jpg"},{"name":"A Long, Hidden Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/ac8374bb6ac3d098b94a7bdc6c79639c2900403c.jpg"},{"name":"A Cruel Fate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/69745510a568b62d786abc724325ef36f40369a5.jpg"},{"name":"The Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4114350/3e35107866f422a99d251381e79f0e2356e00a5a.jpg"},{"name":"Acceptance.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity